    "name": "The Light Switch",
    "steam_appid": 3681220,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadow speaks to you. It wants to play a game. You'll have only a few seconds to find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different game modes, each using light and shadow in a unique way - think quickly, look intently, don't miss any details. You wouldn't want to make the shadow angry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ways to play: Story Mode, Custom Mode, and Endless Mode each offer a different experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 random events involving light, sound, and the objects in the room mean that every playthrough is different - don't get disoriented when your world gets turned upside down, literally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three endings requiring mastery of the game modes tell the story. Why are you haunted by darkness itself?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadow wants to play, but they will keep you on your toes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDE AND SEEK</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadow will find somewhere in the room to hide. No peeking until it's done moving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/13f2d95589430f06d594e5b714d8e1c0.poster.avif?t=1750877045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/13f2d95589430f06d594e5b714d8e1c0.webm?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/13f2d95589430f06d594e5b714d8e1c0.mp4?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLASHLIGHT TAG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power is out. Use your flashlight to find the shadow before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/fcfe5f0ae9e0eb90262818030a5bf703.poster.avif?t=1750877045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/fcfe5f0ae9e0eb90262818030a5bf703.webm?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/fcfe5f0ae9e0eb90262818030a5bf703.mp4?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORM CHASER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when your batteries are out, you can still play. Wait for the lightning strike and find the shadow. But this is the lightning round - you won't have much time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/fe5b2ec1b1d384f185ca42050d44da6f.poster.avif?t=1750877045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/fe5b2ec1b1d384f185ca42050d44da6f.webm?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/fe5b2ec1b1d384f185ca42050d44da6f.mp4?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROP HUNT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadow is hiding something. Look closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/5508d4236d1e216204da3e7a80b49f47.poster.avif?t=1750877045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/5508d4236d1e216204da3e7a80b49f47.webm?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/5508d4236d1e216204da3e7a80b49f47.mp4?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ways to Play:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing the Main Story, you will unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Mode - play with only the game modes you want to, with adjustable difficulty and chance of random events happening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode - the shadow will move quickly and change the game on you often, and it will get harder as time goes on. How long can you survive?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains content that some may find disturbing, including indirect references to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suicide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/6dc460f122caba87db9b14eae2a30abe.poster.avif?t=1750877045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/6dc460f122caba87db9b14eae2a30abe.webm?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681220/extras/6dc460f122caba87db9b14eae2a30abe.mp4?t=1750877045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
